## Secrets / local config — NEVER commit (DevSecOps)
# user-secrets live outside the repo (%APPDATA%\Microsoft\UserSecrets) and are safe,
# but block any secret-bearing files that might land in the tree:
secrets.json
*.secrets.json
appsettings.*.local.json
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.Staging.json
*.env
.env
.env.*
# certs / keys
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
# EF Core local SQL dumps / LocalDB artifacts
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.bak
